Package: StructuralModelTester
Title: Visual Structural Model Tester
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Baptiste", email = "baptiste@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Jamovi-inspired Shiny workbench for path / SEM models: draw
    confirmatory, exploratory, fixed, measurement, and interaction links on a
    canvas; fit with p-values or AIC/BIC search (optional Σw rejection and model
    averaging); simulate from unstandardized expected slopes; inspect
    conditional / marginal effects; and run confirmatory Monte Carlo power
    analysis.
